This folder contains data and scripts related to the manuscript entitled: "What matters for wind farm layout optimization? An assessment based on the effective layout" distance by Baricchio et al.

data: contains all the results obtained in the study, i.e. the layouts obtained for the different implementation choices and their corresponding performance metrics, stored as csv files.

example_run: contains an example python script to run an optimization case, and all input data and objective functions used in the study.

generate_figures: contains the script used to generate the figures of the results shown in the manuscript, obtained by loading the corresponding pickle files included in the folder.

python_env.yaml: describe the python packages and their versions used for this study.
